    <fr:title text="Relative Topology">Relative Topology</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>
Let <fr:tex display="inline">(X,\tau )</fr:tex> be a topological space and <fr:tex display="inline">A\subseteq  X</fr:tex>. Then <fr:tex display="inline">\tau _A=\{U\cap  A\mid  U\in \tau \}</fr:tex> is a topology on <fr:tex display="inline">A</fr:tex> called the <html:strong>relative topology</html:strong> on <fr:tex display="inline">A</fr:tex> induced by <fr:tex display="inline">\tau </fr:tex>.
</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
